    {
      "type": "volkovlabs-echarts-panel",
      "title": "",
      "description": "Spans Tempo stored over the range for the service chosen above. p95 and the maximum are over server spans. Counted per hour and summed over the range: Tempo answers its range queries, not instant ones, for these panels. A p95 needs 20 server spans, or it reads —.",
